      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan judges that the formation of truthful floating ice in the ninth layer is the foundation for building the whole of Crazed Demon Cave, and that Book Mountain and Primordial Domain are cores Heavenly Court took out of that formation.",
      "chapters": [
        2187
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "crazed-demon-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_book_mountain",
        "loc_primordial_domain",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Limitless Demon Venerable set the Crazed Demon formation; it reaches rank nine, and the expedition becomes a contest to seize its derivation results toward eternal life.",
      "chapters": [
        2189
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "crazed-demon-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Derivation Gu sits as the formation’s core: Limitless obtained that legendary Gu and used it in the Crazed Demon formation, and after the cave battle Star Constellation Immortal Venerable recovers it from truthful floating ice to build her own human path derivation formation.",
      "chapters": [
        2274
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "crazed-demon-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court infiltrates the Crazed Demon formation deeply enough to remove Book Mountain and Primordial Domain as cores, so it already knows the derivation’s state. Not Immortal says Star Constellation Immortal Venerable can be considered half the formation’s owner: she activates and accelerates the formation without disrupting its derivation, so Limitless Demon Venerable’s arrangements do not trigger. If she unifies the eighth-layer great worlds and holds the fuel and clues for derivation, grasp over the formation can rise further, and the text raises the possibility that the Crazed Demon formation might even change owners.",
      "chapters": [
        2190
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-ownership",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Star Constellation later states she already controls half the formation, keeps Heavenly Court immortals on truthful floating ice pieces, and pushes derivation toward one final ice piece that would carry the carved truth of eternal life if Limitless’ arrangements succeed.",
      "chapters": [
        2195
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-ownership",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Limitless dies and the Crazed Demon formation is destroyed in the later contest, ending his retaliation method over the site.",
      "chapters": [
        2209
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-ownership",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
